<title>USA: Ford sets regular qtly payout of $0.385/shr.</title>
<headline>Ford sets regular qtly payout of $0.385/shr.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co said Thursday its board had declared an unchanged first-quarter dividend of $0.385 a share on Class B and common stock, payable March 1, record January 30.</p>
</text>
